        "06": "https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Yasser-Al-Dosari/070003.mp3"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "arab": "تَعْرُجُ ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةُ وَٱلرُّوحُ إِلَيْهِ فِى يَوْمٍۢ كَانَ مِقْدَارُهُۥ خَمْسِينَ أَلْفَ سَنَةٍۢ",
      "arab_kemenag": "تَعْرُجُ الْمَلٰۤىِٕكَةُ وَالرُّوْحُ اِلَيْهِ فِيْ يَوْمٍ كَانَ مِقْدَارُهٗ خَمْسِيْنَ اَلْفَ سَنَةٍۚ",
      "latin": "Ta‘rujul-malā'ikatu war-rūḥu ilaihi fī yaumin kāna miqdāruhū khamsīna alfa sanah(tin).",
      "translation_id": "Para malaikat dan Rūḥ (Jibril) naik (menghadap) kepada-Nya dalam sehari yang kadarnya lima puluh ribu tahun.",
      "translation_en": "The angels and the Spirit will ascend to Him during a Day the extent of which is fifty thousand years.",
